  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre TEMPO 270 V2 is a women's performance racquet developed specifically around female biomechanics. It features a 100 sq.in head, 270 g unstrung weight and a shortened 67.5 cm frame using X-SHORT technology to improve maneuverability and racquet-head acceleration. Combined with ISOFLEX and Superlight Cap technologies, the racquet delivers effortless power, increased spin and a larger sweet spot while remaining exceptionally easy to swing.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre TEMPO 270 V2 是专为女性球员人体工学打造的高性能球拍。采用100平方英寸拍面、270克空拍重量以及67.5厘米加速型拍长，配合 X-SHORT 技术降低挥拍惯性，使拍头更容易加速。ISOFLEX 技术扩大甜区，而 Superlight Cap 则进一步减轻拍头重量，提升挥拍速度与灵活性。整体拥有优秀的力量输出、旋转能力及舒适手感，非常适合女性球员、青少年以及希望使用轻量球拍的俱乐部球员。"
  },

